<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6699" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακηκίω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spout up, gush forth,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεκήκιεν αἷμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					7.262
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακηκίει ἱδρώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					13.705
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέτρης</span>
			<i>from</i> . . , <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.227
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> rare in Prose,
				<i>bubble up, throb violently,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				251b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> causal,
				<i>make to spout out,</i> freq. in later 
				Ep.
			, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.600
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				12.359
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Tryph.
				322
			</span></i>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ</span>
			
				Ep.
			, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηκίω.</span>]</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
